      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE DAN (1) won again in an impressive display to bring up four wins on the bounce at this track over 340m (19.21). Unbeaten from this box in five starts. Hard to fault his form and makes plenty of appeal again. JUNEAU REST (5) could finish only among the minors last time (19.38) at this track, bringing a two run winning streak to an end. Solid record here at this trip including four wins. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. PUSH THE BUTTON (2) failed to come into contention last start at this track, but prior to that won by 0.8 lengths at this track (19.61) beating Grapefruit Racer in a Grade 3/4 on August 4. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Cannot be taken lightly. ",
